OL,3,GNEWSA'Missed opportunities' to save
OL,4,Ababy, inquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA five-month-old girl who died from
OL,7,Fmeningitis may have lived had
OL,8,Fantibiotics been given earlier and had
OL,9,Fdoctors looked beyond their diagnosis
OL,10,Fof Covid, an inquest has been told.
OL,12,FEsta High died at Leeds General
OL,13,FInfirmary (LGI) on 2 November 2023 from
OL,14,Fa bacterial infection two days after
OL,15,Fher parents took her to the hospital's
OL,16,Femergency department due to her high
OL,17,Ftemperature and vomiting.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
