OL,3,GNEWSA'Missed opportunities' to save
OL,4,Ababy, inquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury inquest into her death, at
OL,7,FWakefield Coroner's Court, heard how
OL,8,Fdoctors did not give the baby
OL,9,Fantibiotics until it was too late to
OL,10,Fsave her.
OL,12,FPaediatric consultant Simon Nadel
OL,13,Fagreed there were "missed
OL,14,Fopportunities" at LGI that "more than
OL,15,Fminimally, negligibly or trivially"
OL,16,Fcontributed to Esta's death.
